    "standard-dialogue-after-completing-rogue-trader-using-an-al-kharid-flyer-on-ali-morrisane": [
      {
        "player": "Hi! I have this money off voucher!"
      },
      {
        "npc": "Oh! Unfortunately it seems to have expired yesterday!"
      },
      {
        "player": "But I only just got it from Ali the Leaflet dropper!"
      },
      {
        "npc": "I'm sorry, there's nothing I can do."
      },
      {
        "player": "But you're the one that had them printed!"
      },
      {
        "npc": "Look, I had those printed to win over the local traders. They weren't too pleased with the money off voucher, but I promised them I would repay their losses."
      },
      {
        "player": "So that would be why they're all out of date then?"
      },
      {
        "npc": "I don't know what you mean..."
      },
      {
        "npc": "Anyway, it would be a shame for you to leave without looking at my wares."
      },
